    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"astronomy"</span></span><span>, </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"movies"</span></span><span>, </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"mythology"</span></span><span>
]

MAX_DAILY_LEARNS = </span><span><span class="hljs-number">5</span></span><span>

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">Spycon</span></span><span>:
    </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">__init__</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-params">self</span></span><span>):
        </span><span><span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span></span><span>.knowledge_path = </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"data/spycon_knowledge.json"</span></span><span>
        </span><span><span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span></span><span>.stats_path = </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"data/spycon_stats.json"</span></span><span>
        </span><span><span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span></span><span>.knowledge = </span><span><span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span></span><span>._load(</span><span><span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span></span><span>.knowledge_path, {})
        </span><span><span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span></span><span>.stats = </span><span><span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span></span><span>._load(</span><span><span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span></span><span>.stats_path, {</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"count"</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-number">0</span></span><span>, </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"date"</span></span><span>: time.strftime(</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"%Y-%m-%d"</span></span><span>)})

    </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">_load</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-params">self, path, default</span></span><span>):
        </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span></span><span> os.path.exists(path):
            </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">return</span></span><span> json.load(</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">open</span></span><span>(path))
        </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">return</span></span><span> default

    </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">_save</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-params">self</span></span><span>):
        json.dump(</span><span><span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span></span><span>.knowledge, </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">open</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span></span><span>.knowledge_path, </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"w"</span></span><span>), indent=</span><span><span class="hljs-number">2</span></span><span>)
        json.dump(</span><span><span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span></span><span>.stats, </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">open</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span></span><span>.stats_path, </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"w"</span></span><span>), indent=</span><span><span class="hljs-number">2</span></span><span>)

    </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">_reset_daily_limit</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-params">self</span></span><span>):
        today = time.strftime(</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"%Y-%m-%d"</span></span><span>)
        </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span></span><span>.stats[</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"date"</span></span><span>] != today:
            </span><span><span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span></span><span>.stats = {</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"count"</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-number">0</span></span><span>, </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"date"</span></span><span>: today}

    </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">can_learn</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-params">self</span></span><span>):
        </span><span><span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span></span><span>._reset_daily_limit()
        </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">return</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span></span><span>.stats[</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"count"</span></span><span>] &lt; MAX_DAILY_LEARNS

    </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">is_topic_allowed</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-params">self, topic</span></span><span>):
        </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">return</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">any</span></span><span>(t </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">in</span></span><span> topic.lower() </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">for</span></span><span> t </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">in</span></span><span> ALLOWED_TOPICS)

    </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">learn_from_wikipedia</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-params">self, topic</span></span><span>):
        </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">not</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span></span><span>.is_topic_allowed(topic):
            </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">return</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"Topic rejected by safety filter."</span></span><span>

        </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">not</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span></span><span>.can_learn():
            </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">return</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"Daily learning limit reached."</span></span><span>

        url = </span><span><span class="hljs-string">f"https://en.wikipedia.org/api/rest_v1/page/summary/<span class="hljs-subst">{topic.replace(<span class="hljs-string">' '</span></span></span></span><span>, </span><span><span class="hljs-string">'_'</span></span><span>)}"
        r = requests.get(url, timeout=</span><span><span class="hljs-number">10</span></span><span>)

        </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span></span><span> r.status_code != </span><span><span class="hljs-number">200</span></span><span>:
            </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">return</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"Knowledge source unavailable."</span></span><span>

        data = r.json()
