</span><span><span class="hljs-quote">&gt; ‚ÄúSame axis, higher step. Progress doesn‚Äôt always feel lateral.‚Äù</span></span><span>

This allows:
</span><span><span class="hljs-bullet">-</span></span><span> Non-repetitive conversations
</span><span><span class="hljs-bullet">-</span></span><span> Philosophical depth without hallucination
</span><span><span class="hljs-bullet">-</span></span><span> Safe, bounded reasoning

Spycon does </span><span><span class="hljs-strong">**not**</span></span><span> claim consciousness or autonomy.
